# Game assets (copyrighted EA / RA2 original assets) — excluded on purpose
*.mix
*.gbf
*.bin
*.yrm
*.dmp
*.pack
*.exe
*.rgout
*.sav
*.mmx
*.pkl
*.log
*.jsonl

# Full RA2 / Yuri's Revenge installs used as test benches — copyrighted EA
# assets plus gamemd.exe. Never redistributed (same rule as the extensions above).
ra2bench/
ra2youli/

# Local state / caches
.mimosa/
.zcode/
# browser-CDP scratch + live auth QR + session state
.zcode-watch/
.workbuddy/
.pi/
.dsh-probe/
.commandcode/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
node_modules/
out/
scratch/

# Third-party RA2 reverse-engineering lib (Ares-Developers/YRpp), not redistributed
YRpp/
*_controls.stdout.log
*_controls.stderr.log
examples/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 铁律 2：cpp/h 不上公开仓（含"备份"目录里的源码副本）
#   不写 `*.cpp` / `*.h` 全量忽略 —— 仓库里确有少量刻意公开的头文件；
#   只堵实际出现过泄漏风险的三类路径。
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
blitter_hooks*.cpp
blitter_hooks*.h
**/master_backup_*/**/*.cpp
**/master_backup_*/**/*.h

# 编译中间产物
*.obj
*.o
*.pdb
*.ilk
*.exp
*.lib

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 铁律 10：崩溃转储与 except.txt 副本不上公开仓
#   （`ra2youli/` 已整体忽略；这里堵的是被搬到 lead/ 下的证据副本）
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
**/except_after*.txt
**/except_pre*.txt
**/except_post*.txt
**/probe_*/except*.txt

# 扫描器空输出残留
*.err

